，校验输出结构与预期参数的一致性，完成视频监控场景下的目标检测任务规划闭环。\\n场景任务：\\n- video_surveillance: 我将检测测试视频/mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4中的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，并输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。；参数：{'视频对象': '/mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4', '监控目标': '行人、轿车、公交车和卡车', '输出形式': '每帧的位置框、类别和置信度'}\\n已提取参数：{'视频对象': '/mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4', '监控目标': '行人、轿车、公交车和卡车', '输出形式': '每帧的位置框、类别和置信度'}\\n任务提示：\\n- 提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧\\n- 提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等\\n- 提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口\\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\\n</hidden_step>\\n</system_reminder>\"\n    },\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"parameters\": {}\n    },\n    \"routing\": {\n      \"selected_skill\": \"video-object-analytics\",\n      \"allowed_skills\": [\n        \"analyze-video\",\n        \"batch-video-ingestion\",\n        \"camera-health-check\",\n        \"city-video-intelligence\",\n        \"duplicate-event-merge\",\n        \"evidence-package-generation\",\n        \"evidence-snapshot\",\n        \"ffmpeg-utils\",\n        \"frame-sampling\",\n        \"human-review-routing\",\n        \"object-detection\",\n        \"object-statistics\",\n        \"object-tracking\",\n        \"privacy-masking\",\n        \"roi-mapping\",\n        \"single-video-event-analysis\",\n        \"video-embedding-index\",\n        \"video-object-analytics\",\n        \"video-search\",\n        \"video-segment-extraction\",\n        \"video-stream-ingestion\"\n      ],\n      \"selection_owner\": \"lead_agent\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"legacy_invocation\": {\n    \"skill_dir\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/video-object-analytics\",\n    \"skill_file\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/video-object-analytics/SKILL.md\",\n    \"container_skill_file\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/video-object-analytics/SKILL.md\",\n    \"selected_data_sources\": [],\n    \"argv\": [],\n    \"env\": {},\n    \"parameters\": {},\n    \"working_directory\":